# Line endings are a property of this repository, not of a developer's machine.
# Without this file the result depends on each clone's core.autocrlf setting,
# which is how a project ends up with diffs that show every line as changed.
#
# Everything is LF — in the repository AND in the working copy. Every tool this
# project uses (VS Code, IntelliJ, Node, Maven) reads LF on Windows without
# complaint, and the backend's mvnw script *must* be LF to run on Linux and macOS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The exception: cmd.exe misparses a batch file that does not use CRLF.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
